1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,559
A young boy named Tom loved exploring the woods behind his
house.

2
00:00:04,559 --> 00:00:09,349
One sunny afternoon, he followed a path he had never seen
before.

3
00:00:09,349 --> 00:00:14,320
The path led him to a small, quiet clearing with a
sparkling stream.

4
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,500
He knelt by the water and saw something glimmering on the
bottom.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,280
He reached in and pulled out a perfectly smooth, bright
blue stone.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:27,850
It was warm to the touch and pulsed with a very soft,
gentle light.

7
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:32,560
Tom had never seen anything like it and put it safely in
his pocket.

8
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:37,840
He ran back home, excited to show his parents his magical
discovery.

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:41,770
That night, he placed the stone on his nightstand.

10
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:46,000
It filled his room with a calm, blue light as he fell
asleep.
